+/*
+ * A04s (Metal track M6b boot 8): Panfrost's preprocessing, cached, and the
+ * preprocessed NIR let go once it is serialized.
+ *
+ * panfrost_create_shader_state runs pan_shader_preprocess -- the optimisation
+ * loop and the I/O lowering -- on every shader it is given, and only then asks
